{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_12_level_main_12-12_end","groupId":"main_12","stageId":"main_12-12","title":"捂住耳朵","storyCode":"12-14","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-12_end.txt","sourceHash":"691429158be968b800e751bb55869a839107e2317788deb70cbdbe80ddef8212","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"毫无目标的推进之王开始自我怀疑。深池部队、“灰礼帽”与罗德岛围绕通讯站展开了交锋，但最后却发现通讯站早已被搬走。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g2_glasgowoldroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根已经带了批人回来，正在给他们发药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达和汉娜还在找那些可能还藏在某处废墟里的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些日子，地块的处境你们也都知道......会在大街上露面的，已经算是极少数人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定有不少人正躲在某个大楼的小隔间里瑟瑟发抖，靠着深夜里捡来的一点残渣活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推进之王，你要把他们都找出来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然知道我不可能救下每一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但重要的是，要让他们知道即将有一场撤离行动发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否则，大部分人在大公爵们的炮火响起的时候，不会意识到这是个离开这里的机会，他们只会想办法把自己藏得更好些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是他们自己选的，说不定也能活到那些萨卡兹离开这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他们需要知道还有其他的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，好吧，其他的选择......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有几个地方，我几天前听到过一些动静......但愿不只是在废墟里刨食的野兽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，怎么了？你的脸色不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......哈哈，有些不习惯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老施特劳斯和埃米尔太太打起来了，为了一针临时阻断剂，一个刺瞎了另一个的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和阿米娅费了好大劲才把他们分开，但那眼睛还是保不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们本来就没带多少药过来，现在人们聚集在外面，有的人......很恐慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们觉得自己可能会被感染，也有的人根本还没发现自己已经是个感染者了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅说，她没有收到伊内丝约定的联络，她需要去确认伊内丝和博士的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我一个人在下面待不下去，来这里透口气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和你带回来的那些人都很熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟我从小在这里长大，我敢打赌，别说维娜了，就连你和汉娜都没有我熟悉诺伯特区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候你总是没事就在大街小巷里闲逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，诺伯特区就像我的手掌，我知道每一条纹路通向哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，我......我试着去找了很多熟悉的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又去找了麦克拉伦，他不是不回应我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他聋了。我看到他的耳朵里在淌血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我写了字条给他，他分明应该看见了，但......他还是躲回了房间里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有开唱片店的卡什，以前那家伙每次都骗我买那些过气的烂碟，我在他那不知道花了多少冤枉钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他有一条腿已经完全变形了，天知道他是怎么挪过来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个做进口服装生意的布兰达，她以前总借我看龙门的时尚杂志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给她做了烧伤处理，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有克莱尔，艾琳，伊东......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认识他们每一个人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，我们回来只是为了看着这一切的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们回来到底是为了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，维娜，如果我们只能眼睁睁看着这一切发生，如果我们没有一点改变的方法，是不是我们从一开始......就该忘了这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看过那些英雄们的故事，他们了不起的冒险与旅途，他们匡扶正义，打倒邪恶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而英雄以外的人物，只不过是传奇的背景板，他们的存在只是让故事里的主角们有个搭话的对象，有个成长的契机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直以为我们就在这样的故事里，我一直为此沾沾自喜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我认识他们每一个人，该死的，我认识他们每一个人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不能被概括为怪物摧毁了村庄，英雄杀死了怪物那么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是个烂俗的复仇小说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，我与他们一起生活了二十年，他们不是英雄哀伤时念叨的几个名字，不是杀死恶徒前几句轻飘飘的旁白闪回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......他们不该......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，我明白——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜！亚历山德莉娜·维娜·维多利亚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你回到这个国家，是为了取回属于你的那顶了不起的王冠，缔造又一位阿斯兰王不朽的传奇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是为了回家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，求求你，告诉我，这些都只是暂时的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以告诉我，我们只需要再坚持一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"泪水从眼前这个推进之王再熟悉不过的人的脸上滚落。\n在她的印象里，除了在录像厅，她几乎没见过摩根哭的样子。\n诸王之息永远冰冷，诸王之息永远沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，维娜，我不是在怪你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是走在大街上，然后一抬头，猛然发现......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们真的失去诺伯特区了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"朋友走散，房间寂静无声，仿佛过往的热闹与欢愉都是错觉。\n这里的陈设还是以前的样子，和她们离开时没什么不同。\n这里什么都不剩下了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_i04"},{"type":"narration","text":"这些日子里，推进之王总是下意识地去触碰那柄名为诸王之息的剑。\n她又一次习惯性地把手搭在剑柄上。\n她试图从中感受到某种能量、某种激励，就算是某种责任或注定牺牲的命运也好。\n她一次又一次地失望。\n自己回来是为了什么？只是经历这一切吗？\n还是那些落在自己身上的期待的眼光根本就选错了人，这柄剑和自己的老师只是带给了自己太多的错觉，让她自以为可以成为某种象征？\n推进之王从未如此痛恨过自己的犹豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许......我回来，只是为了不让自己后悔。不让自己在多年以后发现当初什么都没做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道自己会走向哪里......但我只是，无法忍受。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g6_hotellobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一个寓言吗，考伯特先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在试图描述维多利亚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寓言？不不，我不是个说话喜欢绕弯子的人，只是些老人的怀旧情绪罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们坐在这里，总要说些话打发时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是更关注未来，“维多利亚的”萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔拉人，你们的准备很充分，你们应该带进来了不少人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我猜，你们同样不想和我鳞死网破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你老实待在这里，就什么都不会发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们想独吞那架飞空艇的技术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开斯特公爵派遣你进入地块，难道是来散步的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可以共享，萨卡兹对于飞空艇的防守......想必不会太松懈，这对任何人都不会是一次轻松的任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果我们合作，这种技术可以不只属于某一位大公爵，它可以属于维多利亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不在乎维多利亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，你们已经下定了决心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前说过，我们对彼此的目标，都很有默契。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鉴于这种默契，我可以尽量不为难你，开斯特的宠物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才明明想杀了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，要我道个歉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的任务失败了，最多不过是降职处罚，但总归可以保住自己的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你坚持想拿到开斯特公爵的表彰和提拔，可以试试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老威灵顿的手下和他一样固执，这次我算是领教到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我可以待在这里，把飞空艇的技术让给你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我也有交换的条件。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看来你打算重新评估和我们的关系了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"形势如此，罗德岛的博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们拒绝了我成为朋友的邀约，就只能再度沦为棋子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会带走国剑，温德米尔的女儿和亚历山德莉娜要死在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"认命了，继承人小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有收到介入这些事情的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，你答应了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是已经达成的交易，开斯特公爵永远兑现承诺。每一项承诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，“校官”，这是我们最大的原则。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（伊内丝。）","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（明白。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们维多利亚人的坏习惯，是不是从来不问问当事人的意见？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，“灰礼帽”先生，我刚才已经说了，你的比喻很糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把我们称作棋子，同样也是一种比喻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来罗德岛是把和温德米尔公爵的关系当做了自己的救命稻草？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是个好主意，你们站错了队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可以一开始就不选择站队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就只能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温德米尔家的那个女孩......那是幻术和影子结合的源石技艺？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很默契，“灰礼帽”先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟有关原则问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说永远兑现承诺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，是另一条。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不许赢家通吃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这已经没意义了，塔拉人，只要这些家伙的通讯发出，大公爵们的主力舰队就不得不推进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到时候，飞空艇就是谁打下来归谁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，这下咱们都拿不到奖金了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊内丝小姐，赶上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了门外的那些影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛......公爵阁下还不希望和你们闹翻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚刚的出手不算是闹翻吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，你可以道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就让我们，后会有期。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深池部队的尸体......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们果然在这里也布置了人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伤口很新鲜，应该是不久前才留下的。刀伤，伤口仿佛被烧灼过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"空旷的房间内，无人回应。\n戴菲恩握紧了自己的短剑。\n母亲总是训斥她没有把更多的精力放在战斗训练上，但作为以剑术驰名维多利亚的温德米尔公爵的女儿，她有信心应付大部分的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯站应该就在这附近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这，这怎么可能......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一股股杂乱的电线出现在戴菲恩眼前，而本该连接在这些电线上的设备，却不翼而飞。\n桌子上已经留下了一层厚厚的灰尘。\n有人早就来过，搬走了通讯站，而且......早得多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
